From 48456783a15b639f59a5cc4ae04352bf04ffe677 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 19:26:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] PROSE branding: logos, artwork, and the default desktop
 background
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adopts the PROSE artwork (logos and manuscript wallpapers) with three
fixes to how it was wired:

- The "tiny" logos were 1920x626; AboutSystem imports them as resources
  and draws them at native size, so the About window would have been
  blown out ~12x. Scaled to 158x51, matching the stock logo they replace.
- The stock artwork list was replaced outright, which removed
  "HAIKU logo - white on blue - big.png" — the file
  TrackerInitialState.cpp hardcodes as the default desktop background.
  The stock entries are kept and the PROSE files added alongside.
- The wallpapers were shipped but nothing referenced them. Tracker's
  default background is now the PROSE wallpaper, scaled to fit, instead
  of a logo placed at an offset computed for a 605x190 image.

Not adopted: changing uname's sysname from "Haiku" to "Kronkite". It
contradicts the PROSE branding everywhere else, and configure scripts
and package builds detect the OS by that string — it would break
haikuports builds for no visual gain.

Known limitation: the desktop background cannot display yet. This image
has no PNG translator (and build/jam/packages/Haiku packages no
translators at all), because libpng is not available for arm64 in this
build. That is also why the stock logo background never appeared. The
artwork and the Tracker change are in place for when libpng lands.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 build/jam/packages/Haiku                       |   7 ++++++-
 ...ROSE logo - black on transparent - tiny.png | Bin 0 -> 4815 bytes
 .../PROSE logo - paper on ink - big.png        | Bin 0 -> 30555 bytes
 ...ROSE logo - white on transparent - tiny.png | Bin 0 -> 3864 bytes
 .../PROSE wallpaper - manuscript dark.png      | Bin 0 -> 201111 bytes
 .../PROSE wallpaper - manuscript light.png     | Bin 0 -> 205048 bytes
 src/apps/aboutsystem/AboutSystem.rdef          |  10 +++++-----
 src/kits/tracker/TrackerInitialState.cpp       |  11 ++++-------
 8 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 data/artwork/PROSE logo - black on transparent - tiny.png
 create mode 100644 data/artwork/PROSE logo - paper on ink - big.png
 create mode 100644 data/artwork/PROSE logo - white on transparent - tiny.png
 create mode 100644 data/artwork/PROSE wallpaper - manuscript dark.png
 create mode 100644 data/artwork/PROSE wallpaper - manuscript light.png

diff --git a/build/jam/packages/Haiku b/build/jam/packages/Haiku
index 1815464a32..173116883c 100644
--- a/build/jam/packages/Haiku
+++ b/build/jam/packages/Haiku
@@ -277,7 +277,12 @@ AddFilesToPackage boot first-login : $(firstLoginFiles) ;
 # artwork and sounds
 local logoArtwork =
 	$(HAIKU_INCLUDE_TRADEMARKS)"HAIKU logo - white on blue - big.png"
-	$(HAIKU_INCLUDE_TRADEMARKS)"HAIKU logo - white on blue - normal.png" ;
+	$(HAIKU_INCLUDE_TRADEMARKS)"HAIKU logo - white on blue - normal.png"
+	# PROSE fork branding (the wallpaper is the default desktop background,
+	# see TrackerInitialState.cpp)
+	"PROSE logo - paper on ink - big.png"
+	"PROSE wallpaper - manuscript light.png"
+	"PROSE wallpaper - manuscript dark.png" ;
 SEARCH on $(logoArtwork) = [ FDirName $(HAIKU_TOP) data artwork ] ;
 AddFilesToPackage data artwork : $(logoArtwork) ;
 
diff --git a/data/artwork/PROSE logo - black on transparent - tiny.png b/data/artwork/PROSE logo - black on transparent - tiny.png
new file mode 100644
